Glass I Faceted 250 16E
Objects: 1;Vectices: 6 722;Polygons: 6 720.
Real-World Scale.Quads-only geometry.
File fomats:

  - Blend 2.93.3 (Native);

  - PNG (Textures);

  - FBX;

  - OBJ;

  - DAE;

  - STL;

  - SVG (UV Map).

Textures are NOT associated with the native format, only Blender Cycles shaders are used here.In total, there are 8 basic colors.Textures are created for export to other formats for various render engines, and only for that.Although their reverse use in Blender is possible.
All textures are square.
Types of textures:

  - Diffuse map  - DIFF;

  - Normal map - NORM;

  - Ambient occlusion - AO;

  - Transparency - T;

  - Roughness map - ROUG;

  - Specular map - SPEC.

*The combination of several abbreviations means that the texture has all the marked characteristics, for example:
  - DIFF_AO_T - This is a transparent diffuse (albedo) map with added ambient occlusion (baked) effect.
Sets of textures by resolution:

  - 4k - 4096x4096 pixels;

  - 2k - 2048x2048 pixels;

  - 1k - 1024x1024 pixels.

ZIP packages are designed in such a way that they are unpacked into one folder (Glass_I_Faceted_250_16E), with all dependencies saved, and subfolders.

